  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "woman is mapped as 'meat' to be slapped on a grill",
  "description": "The text 'cause i'm bout to slap this meat across your grill' explicitly maps the woman's visual representation (her face) onto the concept of 'meat'. This is a misogynistic objectification trope where the woman's body is reduced to a consumable commodity, visually represented by her face being juxtaposed with the vulgar metaphor. The sloth in the top half serves as a humorous, slow-moving visual punchline to the threat, reinforcing the crude and degrading nature of the metaphor.",
